{
  "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
  "duration_s": 632.0,
  "generated_at": "2026-09-04T03:00:09.328810+00:00",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0000",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 0,
      "start_s": 0.0,
      "end_s": 8.72,
      "text": "Every single species on this planet has spent millions of years adapting to Earth.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0001",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 1,
      "start_s": 4.24,
      "end_s": 11.0,
      "text": "Fish developed gills to breathe underwater.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0002",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 2,
      "start_s": 6.28,
      "end_s": 13.16,
      "text": "Birds evolved hollow bones to fly.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0003",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 3,
      "start_s": 8.72,
      "end_s": 15.16,
      "text": "Polar bears grew thick fur to survive the Arctic.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0004",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 4,
      "start_s": 11.0,
      "end_s": 15.16,
      "text": "And then there's us.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0005",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 5,
      "start_s": 13.16,
      "end_s": 16.88,
      "text": "We burn in our own sunlight.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0006",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 6,
      "start_s": 13.16,
      "end_s": 19.4,
      "text": "Our spines are falling apart.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0007",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 7,
      "start_s": 15.16,
      "end_s": 22.88,
      "text": "We give birth in a process so violent it kills us more than any other mammal on the planet.",
      "n_words": 19
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0008",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 8,
      "start_s": 19.4,
      "end_s": 28.24,
      "text": "And we're the only species that looked around at the world it evolved in and thought, \"Something's off.\"",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0009",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 9,
      "start_s": 24.68,
      "end_s": 33.0,
      "text": "What if the reason we don't fit on Earth is because we're not from here?",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0010",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 10,
      "start_s": 28.24,
      "end_s": 35.0,
      "text": "Lizards sit in direct sunlight for hours.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0011",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 11,
      "start_s": 30.0,
      "end_s": 42.12,
      "text": "Dogs, cats, horses, elephants, they spend their entire lives under the same sun and handle it just fine.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0012",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 12,
      "start_s": 37.12,
      "end_s": 46.68,
      "text": "Their fur, their scales, their pigmentation, all perfectly calibrated for our star.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0013",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 13,
      "start_s": 42.12,
      "end_s": 48.48,
      "text": "Ours isn't.",
      "n_words": 2
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0014",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 14,
      "start_s": 44.8,
      "end_s": 52.199999999999996,
      "text": "We literally had to invent a chemical paste and rub it on ourselves just to go outside safely.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0015",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 15,
      "start_s": 48.48,
      "end_s": 54.04,
      "text": "Think about that for a second.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0016",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 16,
      "start_s": 50.36,
      "end_s": 58.8,
      "text": "We invented sunscreen because our own sun is trying to kill us.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0017",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 17,
      "start_s": 54.04,
      "end_s": 58.8,
      "text": "Now, look at your back.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0018",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 18,
      "start_s": 54.04,
      "end_s": 62.36,
      "text": "80% of humans will experience chronic back pain at some point in their lives.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0019",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 19,
      "start_s": 58.8,
      "end_s": 69.92,
      "text": "When four out of five members of your species share the same structural problem, you stop blaming the individual and start looking at the blueprint.",
      "n_words": 25
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0020",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 20,
      "start_s": 66.0,
      "end_s": 73.88,
      "text": "Our spines are essentially a horizontal bridge that evolution tried to stand upright.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0021",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 21,
      "start_s": 69.92,
      "end_s": 80.32,
      "text": "The discs between our vertebrae compress under gravity in ways they were never meant to handle.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0022",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 22,
      "start_s": 75.88,
      "end_s": 83.03999999999999,
      "text": "Other bipedal animals like kangaroos and ostriches don't have this issue.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0023",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 23,
      "start_s": 80.32,
      "end_s": 87.72,
      "text": "[clears throat] Their bodies were built from the ground up for standing.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0024",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 24,
      "start_s": 83.04,
      "end_s": 87.72,
      "text": "Ours were retrofitted, badly.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0025",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 25,
      "start_s": 85.84,
      "end_s": 89.60000000000001,
      "text": "Then there's childbirth.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0026",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 26,
      "start_s": 85.84,
      "end_s": 91.92,
      "text": "This one's rough.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0027",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 27,
      "start_s": 87.72,
      "end_s": 96.36,
      "text": "Human childbirth is the most dangerous birth process of any mammal on the planet.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0028",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 28,
      "start_s": 91.92,
      "end_s": 98.36,
      "text": "Our babies' heads are so big they barely fit through the birth canal.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0029",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 29,
      "start_s": 96.36,
      "end_s": 104.12,
      "text": "Before modern medicine, giving birth was one of the leading causes of death for women throughout all of human history.",
      "n_words": 20
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0030",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 30,
      "start_s": 102.04,
      "end_s": 108.16000000000001,
      "text": "No other species routinely dies trying to deliver healthy offspring.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0031",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 31,
      "start_s": 104.12,
      "end_s": 110.24,
      "text": "That's just us.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0032",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 32,
      "start_s": 105.8,
      "end_s": 112.36,
      "text": "A horse gives birth in about 30 minutes.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0033",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 33,
      "start_s": 108.16,
      "end_s": 114.67999999999999,
      "text": "The foal stands up and walks within the hour.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0034",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 34,
      "start_s": 110.24,
      "end_s": 116.84,
      "text": "A human baby can't even hold up its own head for months.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0035",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 35,
      "start_s": 112.36,
      "end_s": 124.32000000000001,
      "text": "We show up completely useless, dependent on others for years, more helpless than any other animal that has ever existed on this planet.",
      "n_words": 23
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0036",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 36,
      "start_s": 120.68,
      "end_s": 126.68,
      "text": "And then there are allergies.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0037",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 37,
      "start_s": 122.04,
      "end_s": 128.79999999999998,
      "text": "Your immune system has one job, protect you.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0038",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 38,
      "start_s": 124.32,
      "end_s": 133.48000000000002,
      "text": "But in humans, this system regularly goes to war against things that are completely harmless.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0039",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 39,
      "start_s": 130.56,
      "end_s": 138.04,
      "text": "Pollen, peanuts, dust, cat hair, shellfish.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0040",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 40,
      "start_s": 133.48,
      "end_s": 140.07999999999998,
      "text": "About 30% of the global population has allergies.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0041",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 41,
      "start_s": 136.04,
      "end_s": 144.64000000000001,
      "text": "Your own defense system is attacking the air you breathe and the food you eat.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0042",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 42,
      "start_s": 140.08,
      "end_s": 150.72,
      "text": "Either evolution made a serious mistake or your body is calibrated for somewhere else entirely.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0043",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 43,
      "start_s": 146.48,
      "end_s": 152.6,
      "text": "But the strangest part isn't physical.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0044",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 44,
      "start_s": 148.68,
      "end_s": 152.6,
      "text": "It's in your head.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0045",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 45,
      "start_s": 148.68,
      "end_s": 154.48,
      "text": "No other animal on Earth knows it's going to die.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0046",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 46,
      "start_s": 152.6,
      "end_s": 159.07999999999998,
      "text": "Dogs don't lie awake wondering what happens after death.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0047",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 47,
      "start_s": 154.48,
      "end_s": 160.84,
      "text": "Dolphins don't have existential crises.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0048",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 48,
      "start_s": 156.96,
      "end_s": 165.88,
      "text": "Elephants don't build religions to cope with the terror of mortality.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0049",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 49,
      "start_s": 160.84,
      "end_s": 165.88,
      "text": "But we do, all of us.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0050",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 50,
      "start_s": 160.84,
      "end_s": 171.48000000000002,
      "text": "We are the only species walking around with the full awareness that one day we'll stop existing.",
      "n_words": 17
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0051",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 51,
      "start_s": 168.12,
      "end_s": 175.28,
      "text": "And instead of just dealing with it, we've spent our entire history trying to solve it.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0052",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 52,
      "start_s": 171.48,
      "end_s": 183.56,
      "text": "We build temples, we write philosophies, we create entire civilizations organized around the question of what happens when we die.",
      "n_words": 20
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0053",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 53,
      "start_s": 179.16,
      "end_s": 185.76,
      "text": "Why would evolution do this to us?",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0054",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 54,
      "start_s": 181.2,
      "end_s": 185.76,
      "text": "Seriously.",
      "n_words": 1
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0055",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 55,
      "start_s": 181.2,
      "end_s": 187.48,
      "text": "What survival advantage does existential dread provide?",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0056",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 56,
      "start_s": 183.56,
      "end_s": 193.56,
      "text": "For most of human history, this awareness has driven people to despair, to madness, to war.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0057",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 57,
      "start_s": 190.04,
      "end_s": 198.84,
      "text": "It feels like a feature you'd find in a species that's out of place, conscious enough to sense something is wrong, but unable to figure out what.",
      "n_words": 27
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0058",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 58,
      "start_s": 197.4,
      "end_s": 203.08,
      "text": "And then there's the one that's hardest to explain away.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0059",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 59,
      "start_s": 198.84,
      "end_s": 207.64000000000001,
      "text": "Every species on this planet exists in some kind of balance with its ecosystem.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0060",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 60,
      "start_s": 203.08,
      "end_s": 210.24,
      "text": "Predators keep prey in check.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0061",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 61,
      "start_s": 205.44,
      "end_s": 212.55999999999997,
      "text": "Prey keeps plant life in check.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0062",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 62,
      "start_s": 207.64,
      "end_s": 215.0,
      "text": "Decomposers recycle nutrients back into the soil.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0063",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 63,
      "start_s": 210.24,
      "end_s": 215.0,
      "text": "It's a closed loop.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0064",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 64,
      "start_s": 212.56,
      "end_s": 217.56,
      "text": "Everybody plays their part, except us.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0065",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 65,
      "start_s": 215.0,
      "end_s": 223.08,
      "text": "We clear-cut forests, we poison rivers, we pump the atmosphere full of gases that heat the planet.",
      "n_words": 17
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0066",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 66,
      "start_s": 219.4,
      "end_s": 226.60000000000002,
      "text": "We've driven thousands of species to extinction and we're not even close to slowing down.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0067",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 67,
      "start_s": 224.92,
      "end_s": 230.48,
      "text": "We're not participating in Earth's ecosystem.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0068",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 68,
      "start_s": 226.6,
      "end_s": 230.48,
      "text": "We're taking it apart.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0069",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 69,
      "start_s": 226.6,
      "end_s": 237.79999999999998,
      "text": "And if you think about it, that's exactly what you'd expect from an invasive species, something dropped onto a planet it wasn't built for.",
      "n_words": 24
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0070",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 70,
      "start_s": 233.88,
      "end_s": 243.36,
      "text": "It doesn't know the rules because the rules weren't written for it.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0071",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 71,
      "start_s": 237.8,
      "end_s": 245.0,
      "text": "So, if we really don't belong here, where did we come from?",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0072",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 72,
      "start_s": 240.4,
      "end_s": 249.72,
      "text": "In 1973, Francis Crick published a paper that should have shaken the scientific world.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0073",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 73,
      "start_s": 246.88,
      "end_s": 257.28,
      "text": "He won the Nobel Prize in 1962 for figuring out how the molecule that carries all of life's instructions actually works.",
      "n_words": 21
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0074",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 74,
      "start_s": 253.2,
      "end_s": 260.04,
      "text": "He's one of the most important scientists who ever lived.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0075",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 75,
      "start_s": 255.12,
      "end_s": 266.96,
      "text": "And in that 1973 paper, written with chemist Leslie Orgel, he proposed something wild.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0076",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 76,
      "start_s": 262.32,
      "end_s": 274.4,
      "text": "He called it directed panspermia, the idea that life on Earth didn't start here, that it was deliberately seeded by an intelligent civilization from somewhere else in the galaxy.",
      "n_words": 29
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0077",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 77,
      "start_s": 270.44,
      "end_s": 278.88,
      "text": "The man who decoded DNA looked at the story of life on Earth and said, \"I don't think this adds up.\"",
      "n_words": 21
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0078",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 78,
      "start_s": 276.12,
      "end_s": 283.68,
      "text": "And honestly, the evidence backing him up is hard to dismiss.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0079",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 79,
      "start_s": 278.88,
      "end_s": 286.64000000000004,
      "text": "Life showed up on Earth roughly 3.8 billion years ago.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0080",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 80,
      "start_s": 280.92,
      "end_s": 288.52,
      "text": "The planet itself is only about 4.5 billion years old.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0081",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 81,
      "start_s": 286.64,
      "end_s": 294.4,
      "text": "That means complex organic chemistry appeared just 700 million years after Earth formed.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0082",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 82,
      "start_s": 290.76,
      "end_s": 296.36,
      "text": "In geological time, that's basically overnight.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0083",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 83,
      "start_s": 292.72,
      "end_s": 303.64000000000004,
      "text": "The planet was still getting hammered by asteroids, still cooling from a molten hellscape of rock and toxic gas.",
      "n_words": 19
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0084",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 84,
      "start_s": 298.6,
      "end_s": 307.36,
      "text": "And somehow, life popped up almost the second conditions allowed it.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0085",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 85,
      "start_s": 303.64,
      "end_s": 310.47999999999996,
      "text": "Biologists have always found the timing suspicious.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0086",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 86,
      "start_s": 305.52,
      "end_s": 312.16,
      "text": "Then there's the Murchison meteorite.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0087",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 87,
      "start_s": 307.36,
      "end_s": 316.40000000000003,
      "text": "In 1969, a rock from space crashed into southeastern Australia.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0088",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 88,
      "start_s": 312.16,
      "end_s": 322.16,
      "text": "When scientists cracked it open, they found over 90 different amino acids inside, the building blocks of life.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0089",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 89,
      "start_s": 318.44,
      "end_s": 325.52000000000004,
      "text": "And some of those amino acids are the exact same ones found in every living thing on Earth.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0090",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 90,
      "start_s": 322.16,
      "end_s": 329.03999999999996,
      "text": "Organic chemistry, just riding through space on a rock.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0091",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 91,
      "start_s": 325.52,
      "end_s": 329.03999999999996,
      "text": "And here's the thing.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0092",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 92,
      "start_s": 325.52,
      "end_s": 331.04,
      "text": "We know life can actually survive out there.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0093",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 93,
      "start_s": 329.04,
      "end_s": 344.08,
      "text": "Tardigrades, those microscopic little guys that look like eight-legged gummy bears, have been exposed to the vacuum of space, to cosmic radiation, to temperatures near absolute zero, and they made it.",
      "n_words": 31
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0094",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 94,
      "start_s": 339.12,
      "end_s": 347.91999999999996,
      "text": "In 2019, an Israeli spacecraft carrying tardigrades crashed on the moon.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0095",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 95,
      "start_s": 344.08,
      "end_s": 353.64,
      "text": "Scientists think some of them might still be viable up there, just sitting on the lunar surface, waiting.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0096",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 96,
      "start_s": 349.68,
      "end_s": 357.32000000000005,
      "text": "Life doesn't just exist on Earth.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0097",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 97,
      "start_s": 351.6,
      "end_s": 359.56,
      "text": "It can hitch a ride between worlds.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0098",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 98,
      "start_s": 353.64,
      "end_s": 368.04,
      "text": "In 2013, ecologist Dr. Ellis Silver published a book called Humans Are Not From Earth, pulling together all the physiological evidence that we're poorly adapted to this planet.",
      "n_words": 28
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0099",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 99,
      "start_s": 363.36,
      "end_s": 376.08,
      "text": "The sunburn, the back pain, the allergies, the dangerous childbirth, even our circadian rhythm being slightly off from a 24-hour cycle.",
      "n_words": 21
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0100",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 100,
      "start_s": 371.96,
      "end_s": 378.2,
      "text": "He argued these weren't just quirks of evolution.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0101",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 101,
      "start_s": 374.32,
      "end_s": 380.0,
      "text": "They were signs we came from somewhere else.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0102",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 102,
      "start_s": 376.08,
      "end_s": 385.72,
      "text": "But here's where it gets complicated because mainstream biology actually has a pretty good answer for almost all of it.",
      "n_words": 20
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0103",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 103,
      "start_s": 382.12,
      "end_s": 387.12,
      "text": "It's called evolutionary mismatch.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0104",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 104,
      "start_s": 383.76,
      "end_s": 391.12,
      "text": "And honestly, it might be even more interesting than the alien theory.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0105",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 105,
      "start_s": 387.12,
      "end_s": 392.92,
      "text": "Back pain.",
      "n_words": 2
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0106",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 106,
      "start_s": 389.32,
      "end_s": 394.72,
      "text": "We only started walking upright about 6 million years ago.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0107",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 107,
      "start_s": 391.12,
      "end_s": 397.04,
      "text": "Sounds ancient, right?",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0108",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 108,
      "start_s": 392.92,
      "end_s": 398.68,
      "text": "But evolution moves slow, really slow.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0109",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 109,
      "start_s": 394.72,
      "end_s": 401.88,
      "text": "Our spines haven't had enough generations to fully figure out this whole standing thing.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0110",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 110,
      "start_s": 398.68,
      "end_s": 406.04,
      "text": "We're basically walking around in a prototype that never got its final update.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0111",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 111,
      "start_s": 403.8,
      "end_s": 408.08,
      "text": "Sunburn.",
      "n_words": 1
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0112",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 112,
      "start_s": 403.8,
      "end_s": 408.08,
      "text": "We lost our body hair.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0113",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 113,
      "start_s": 403.8,
      "end_s": 410.20000000000005,
      "text": "Best theory is thermoregulation.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0114",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 114,
      "start_s": 406.04,
      "end_s": 416.88,
      "text": "When our ancestors moved from forests onto open savannas, they needed to cool down while running for hours under the African sun.",
      "n_words": 22
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0115",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 115,
      "start_s": 414.64,
      "end_s": 420.15999999999997,
      "text": "Sweat works way better on bare skin than through fur.",
      "n_words": 10
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0116",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 116,
      "start_s": 416.88,
      "end_s": 427.12,
      "text": "So, we traded our protective coat for the ability to outrun literally every other animal on the planet.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0117",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 117,
      "start_s": 422.64,
      "end_s": 429.08,
      "text": "The sunburn is just the price we pay.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0118",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 118,
      "start_s": 424.56,
      "end_s": 429.08,
      "text": "Childbirth.",
      "n_words": 1
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0119",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 119,
      "start_s": 424.56,
      "end_s": 432.91999999999996,
      "text": "Our brains got bigger faster than our birth canals could keep up.",
      "n_words": 12
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0120",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 120,
      "start_s": 429.08,
      "end_s": 434.76,
      "text": "Scientists call it the obstetric dilemma.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0121",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 121,
      "start_s": 430.88,
      "end_s": 440.59999999999997,
      "text": "Evolution was trying to make us smarter and keep us upright at the same time, and the pelvis basically got caught in the middle.",
      "n_words": 24
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0122",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 122,
      "start_s": 436.64,
      "end_s": 442.16,
      "text": "It's messy.",
      "n_words": 2
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0123",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 123,
      "start_s": 438.48,
      "end_s": 442.16,
      "text": "It's dangerous.",
      "n_words": 2
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0124",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 124,
      "start_s": 438.48,
      "end_s": 443.72,
      "text": "But it makes sense.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0125",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 125,
      "start_s": 440.6,
      "end_s": 447.76000000000005,
      "text": "Even the environmental destruction thing has a rational explanation.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0126",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 126,
      "start_s": 443.72,
      "end_s": 453.16,
      "text": "We evolved in small groups on the savanna where resources felt endless compared to how few of us there were.",
      "n_words": 20
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0127",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 127,
      "start_s": 449.56,
      "end_s": 457.24,
      "text": "Our brains are wired for short-term survival, not managing an entire planet's ecosystem.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0128",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 128,
      "start_s": 453.16,
      "end_s": 459.8,
      "text": "We're not alien invaders.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0129",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 129,
      "start_s": 455.2,
      "end_s": 464.40000000000003,
      "text": "We're just an animal that got way too powerful, way too fast for its own wiring to handle.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0130",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 130,
      "start_s": 459.8,
      "end_s": 465.59999999999997,
      "text": "So, that settles it, right?",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0131",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 131,
      "start_s": 462.2,
      "end_s": 465.59999999999997,
      "text": "Well, not quite.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0132",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 132,
      "start_s": 464.4,
      "end_s": 473.48,
      "text": "Because even after all those explanations, there's one thing evolutionary biology still can't fully account for, the speed.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0133",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 133,
      "start_s": 469.16,
      "end_s": 476.96000000000004,
      "text": "No species in the 4-billion-year history of life on Earth has ever done what we did.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0134",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 134,
      "start_s": 475.04,
      "end_s": 480.91999999999996,
      "text": "Dolphins have been around for roughly 50 million years.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0135",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 135,
      "start_s": 476.96,
      "end_s": 480.91999999999996,
      "text": "They're smart.",
      "n_words": 2
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0136",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 136,
      "start_s": 476.96,
      "end_s": 482.6,
      "text": "They have complex social lives.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0137",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 137,
      "start_s": 478.72,
      "end_s": 482.6,
      "text": "They communicate.",
      "n_words": 2
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0138",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 138,
      "start_s": 480.92,
      "end_s": 486.72,
      "text": "And in all that time, they have never built a single tool, not one.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0139",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 139,
      "start_s": 484.56,
      "end_s": 490.16,
      "text": "Chimpanzees figured out sticks about 4 million years ago.",
      "n_words": 9
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0140",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 140,
      "start_s": 486.72,
      "end_s": 492.08,
      "text": "They have not filed a single upgrade since.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0141",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 141,
      "start_s": 488.44,
      "end_s": 494.12,
      "text": "And then there's us.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0142",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 142,
      "start_s": 490.16,
      "end_s": 507.64,
      "text": "We went from sharpened rocks to nuclear weapons in about 2 million years, from fire to the International Space Station, from cave paintings to artificial intelligence, from banging flint together to landing robots on Mars.",
      "n_words": 35
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0143",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 143,
      "start_s": 502.44,
      "end_s": 510.0,
      "text": "200 years ago, we didn't have railroads.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0144",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 144,
      "start_s": 505.04,
      "end_s": 512.24,
      "text": "125 years ago, airplanes didn't exist.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0145",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 145,
      "start_s": 507.64,
      "end_s": 514.159,
      "text": "75 years ago, we hadn't been to space.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0146",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 146,
      "start_s": 510.0,
      "end_s": 516.12,
      "text": "35 years ago, there was no internet.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0147",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 147,
      "start_s": 512.24,
      "end_s": 520.12,
      "text": "Nothing in the entire history of life on this planet has ever accelerated like that.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0148",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 148,
      "start_s": 516.12,
      "end_s": 521.719,
      "text": "Nothing even comes close.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0149",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 149,
      "start_s": 517.96,
      "end_s": 523.52,
      "text": "And scientists still can't agree on why.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0150",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 150,
      "start_s": 520.12,
      "end_s": 525.2800000000001,
      "text": "Some think it was language.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0151",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 151,
      "start_s": 521.719,
      "end_s": 530.9599999999999,
      "text": "Some think it was cooking, which gave us more calories and let our brains get bigger.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0152",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 152,
      "start_s": 525.28,
      "end_s": 535.32,
      "text": "Some point to a mutation in a gene called FOXP2 that may have unlocked complex speech.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0153",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 153,
      "start_s": 533.24,
      "end_s": 543.68,
      "text": "Others say it was our ability to teach, to stack knowledge across generations, so each one picked up where the last left off.",
      "n_words": 23
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0154",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 154,
      "start_s": 539.52,
      "end_s": 547.64,
      "text": "All of those probably played a role, but none of them fully explain the sheer speed of it.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0155",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 155,
      "start_s": 543.68,
      "end_s": 552.88,
      "text": "Every other intelligent species on Earth took tens of millions of years to develop gradually.",
      "n_words": 15
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0156",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 156,
      "start_s": 548.96,
      "end_s": 556.92,
      "text": "We went from prey animal to running the entire planet in what amounts to a geological blink.",
      "n_words": 17
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0157",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 157,
      "start_s": 552.88,
      "end_s": 558.68,
      "text": "Crick couldn't explain it.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0158",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 158,
      "start_s": 555.04,
      "end_s": 560.64,
      "text": "Silver couldn't explain it.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0159",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 159,
      "start_s": 556.92,
      "end_s": 565.64,
      "text": "And modern evolutionary biology can explain pieces of it, but not the whole thing, not yet.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0160",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 160,
      "start_s": 560.64,
      "end_s": 569.56,
      "text": "The most honest answer science has right now is, we don't fully know.",
      "n_words": 13
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0161",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 161,
      "start_s": 565.64,
      "end_s": 569.56,
      "text": "We've got pieces.",
      "n_words": 3
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0162",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 162,
      "start_s": 568.16,
      "end_s": 571.12,
      "text": "We don't have the full picture.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0163",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 163,
      "start_s": 568.16,
      "end_s": 572.88,
      "text": "And that's what keeps the question alive.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0164",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 164,
      "start_s": 571.12,
      "end_s": 577.16,
      "text": "Look, it's probably not true that we're aliens.",
      "n_words": 8
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0165",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 165,
      "start_s": 572.88,
      "end_s": 579.12,
      "text": "The evolutionary evidence is strong.",
      "n_words": 5
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0166",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 166,
      "start_s": 574.84,
      "end_s": 580.7199999999999,
      "text": "Mismatch theory handles most of the weird stuff about our bodies.",
      "n_words": 11
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0167",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 167,
      "start_s": 577.16,
      "end_s": 587.1999999999999,
      "text": "We're almost certainly a product of this planet, shaped by the same forces that shaped everything else here.",
      "n_words": 18
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0168",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 168,
      "start_s": 582.68,
      "end_s": 588.9599999999999,
      "text": "But almost certainly is not definitely.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0169",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 169,
      "start_s": 584.8,
      "end_s": 596.0799999999999,
      "text": "And when real scientists, including one of the founders of modern genetics, look at the evidence and say, \"Something here doesn't quite add up.\"",
      "n_words": 24
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0170",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 170,
      "start_s": 592.4,
      "end_s": 598.0400000000001,
      "text": "That's not conspiracy talk.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0171",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 171,
      "start_s": 593.96,
      "end_s": 600.0,
      "text": "That's just science doing what science does.",
      "n_words": 7
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0172",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 172,
      "start_s": 596.08,
      "end_s": 603.56,
      "text": "Asking the uncomfortable questions and being honest when the answers don't come out clean.",
      "n_words": 14
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0173",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 173,
      "start_s": 601.72,
      "end_s": 607.04,
      "text": "It's the same curiosity that made us look up at the stars in the first place.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0174",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 174,
      "start_s": 605.24,
      "end_s": 614.6,
      "text": "The same restlessness that made us build rockets and telescopes and send little robots to other planets just to see what's there.",
      "n_words": 22
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0175",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 175,
      "start_s": 610.76,
      "end_s": 616.16,
      "text": "Maybe that restlessness isn't a flaw.",
      "n_words": 6
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0176",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 176,
      "start_s": 612.52,
      "end_s": 616.16,
      "text": "Maybe it's a clue.",
      "n_words": 4
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0177",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 177,
      "start_s": 612.52,
      "end_s": 622.12,
      "text": "Because if we are from here, then we're the strangest thing this planet has ever produced.",
      "n_words": 16
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0178",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 178,
      "start_s": 618.28,
      "end_s": 627.6800000000001,
      "text": "A species that burns in its own sunlight, breaks under its own gravity, and can't stop looking at the sky wondering where it really came from.",
      "n_words": 26
    },
    {
      "sent_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E:s0179",
      "video_id": "_XYNsTvnU7E",
      "idx": 179,
      "start_s": 626.16,
      "end_s": 633.7199999999999,
      "text": "And if we're not from here, then we've been trying to find our way home for 200,000 years and we don't even know it.",
      "n_words": 24
    }
  ]
}